
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Rachael Blakeney.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Rachael Blakeney.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"o26dyn","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481293,"size":4563,"at":1777331817921,"hash":"o26dyn"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,16],"#Characters - Rachael Blakeney":[18,35],"#Characters - Rachael Blakeney#{1}":[20,35]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":15,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Rachael","mommy"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What is this?**  \nRachael Blakeney is the Matriarch of House Blakeney, a Floran Human woman in her 40s. She embodies Althena's \"Mother/Housewife\" aspect—a benevolent, nurturing leader who rules through love and warmth. Her unique trait: a publicly dominant \"Dommy Mommy\" persona that privately inverts into a sexually submissive wife in her marriage.\n\n**When should this entry be selected?**  \nSelect when the narrative involves:  \n- Political or social interactions with House Blakeney  \n- Themes of maternal authority, nurturing leadership, or open marriage  \n- Exploration of Althena's \"Mother\" aspect or Floran culture  \n- Scenes requiring a warm, affectionate, but dominant female figure  \n- Situations where the character's private marital dynamic (power-bottom wife) might be relevant\n\n**Key relationships:**  \n- Husband (unnamed): Her \"manly\" spouse; she is a devoted, sexually submissive \"power-bottom\" to him  \n- Children: Desires a large, happy family; prioritizes their happiness  \n- Althena's faith: Her morality and leadership style are direct extensions of Althena's teachings"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Rachael Blakeney.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"12sghj2","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Rachael Blakeney.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,16],"size":1304,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
